# Notebook JSON does not merge with a line-based diff. Two branches that edit
# different cells still conflict, and a naive resolution can corrupt the file.
# nbdime merges notebooks cell by cell instead.
#
# Enable it locally once:
#
#     pip install nbdime
#     nbdime config-git --enable --global
#
# The driver name must be jupyternotebook: that is what `nbdime config-git`
# registers in .gitconfig. Naming an unregistered driver here makes git fall
# back to a line-based merge silently, with no warning that it did so.
*.ipynb merge=jupyternotebook diff=jupyternotebook
